 Proof. 
 
 Proposition 3.2 reduces
instances of QSP ( ℤ , ℤ n , ⋅ , 2 g ) {\textsf{QSP}}({\mathbb{Z}},{\mathbb{Z}}^{n},\cdot,2g) , satisfying the condition 2 ​ g < n 2g<n ,
